WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
<v Nadia Farouk>Call three. Two changes and a confirmation.</v>

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:10.000
<v Nadia Farouk>Bring back the Low priority tier. We still need it for non-urgent requests.</v>

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.500
<v José García>Low priority returns, with the original three business day first response target.</v>

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
<v José García>Just to confirm, High priority first response is two hours. No change there.</v>

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.500
<v Nadia Farouk>The satisfaction survey after closure should be optional, not forced on the requester.</v>

6
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
<v José García>Understood, the closure survey becomes optional.</v>

7
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.000
<v Nadia Farouk>And on reopening a closed ticket, we decided: a ticket can be reopened within 14 days of closure.</v>

8
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.000
<v José García>Fourteen day reopen window. That resolves last week's open question.</v>

9
00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.000
<v Nadia Farouk>The whole tool should feel fast and effortless, honestly.</v>

10
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.500
<v José García>Noted as a principle. That's everything for today.</v>

11
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Nadia Farouk>Thanks all, talk soon.</v>
